{"id":"d64414d044a898c6db646dcecd122213accd1732","axis":"silent","repo":"vllm-project/vllm","sha":"d64414d044a898c6db646dcecd122213accd1732","parsed":{"files":[{"path":"docs/features/speculative_decoding/README.md","lines":["@@ -139,6 +139,7 @@ only apply to model-based methods such as `draft_model`, `mtp`, `eagle3`, and"," | `num_speculative_tokens` | `integer > 0` | `None` | Number of speculative tokens to propose per step. Required for methods that do not infer it from model metadata. |"," | `draft_tensor_parallel_size` | `integer >= 1` | `None` | Tensor parallel size for the draft model. |"," | `draft_decode_context_parallel_size` | `integer >= 1` | `None` | Decode context parallel size for the draft model: `1` or the target's `decode_context_parallel_size`. Defaults to the target's, except `dflash`/`dspark` drafts, which default to `1` unless they are full-attention MLA. |","+| `draft_enable_eplb` | `boolean` | `true` | Enable EPLB for the draft when target EPLB is enabled. Set to `false` to disable EPLB for the draft. |"," | `max_model_len` | `integer >= 1` | `None` | Maximum context length for the draft model. A draft limit below the target's may also lower the engine's `max_model_len`. |"," | `parallel_drafting` | `boolean` | `null` | Deprecated and has no effect. `dflash` and `dspark` always draft in parallel, and no other method supports it. |"," | `rejection_sample_method` | `string` | `standard` | `standard`, `synthetic`, `block`, or the lossy `fly` verifier. |","@@ -149,6 +150,12 @@ only apply to model-based methods such as `draft_model`, `mtp`, `eagle3`, and"," | `fly_entropy_threshold` | `float >= 0` | `0.3` | Minimum normalized top-k entropy, in `[0, 1]`, required for FLy to defer a native rejection. |"," | `fly_entropy_top_k` | `integer >= 1` | `3` | Number of largest processed target scores renormalized for FLy's entropy gate, capped at the vocabulary size. |"," ","+For an EPLB-backed MoE draft, set its redundant expert count with","+`eplb_config.draft_num_redundant_experts` in addition to configuring","+speculative decoding; the count setting is ignored without a speculative MoE","+draft. See the","+[EPLB deployment guide](../../serving/expert_parallel_deployment.md#multimodel-eplb-with-speculative-decoding).","+"," !!! note","     Gemma 4 assistant checkpoints are handled as Gemma 4 MTP speculators, not","     as generic draft models. Use `\"method\": \"mtp\"` with the assistant"],"additions":7,"deletions":0,"truncated":false},{"path":"docs/serving/expert_parallel_deployment.md","lines":["@@ -200,6 +200,45 @@ Enable EPLB with the `--enable-eplb` flag."," "," When enabled, vLLM collects load statistics with every forward pass and periodically rebalances expert distribution."," ","+### Multimodel EPLB with speculative decoding","+","+When speculative decoding uses a draft model that implements `MixtureOfExperts`","+(for example Qwen3-Next MTP, EAGLE, or DeepSeek DSpark), vLLM registers the","+draft and target in the same `EplbState`. Each model keeps its own expert load","+windows, communicators, and rearrangement maps, but shares the same rearrangement","+step counter across EP ranks.","+","+Target and draft models may have different expert topologies. This is required","+for DeepSeek V4.1 DSpark, where draft layers use `dspark_n_routed_experts`","+while the target backbone uses the full routed-expert count. Each model is","+load-balanced independently.","+","+For supported MoE drafts, target EPLB also enables draft EPLB by default. Set","+`draft_enable_eplb` to `false` in the speculative config to disable EPLB for","+the draft while keeping it enabled for the target. In that case,","+`eplb_config.draft_num_redundant_experts` cannot be set.","+","+For every registered model, `(num_routed_experts + num_redundant_experts)` must","+be divisible by the EP world size.","+","+Set `draft_num_redundant_experts` in `--eplb-config` to select the redundant","+expert count for a speculative MoE draft. This setting is ignored unless a","+speculative MoE draft is configured. When unset, vLLM inherits the target's","+count if the target and draft have the same routed-expert counts and that count","+is valid for the draft. Otherwise, vLLM computes the minimum valid count from","+the draft's routed expert counts and the shared EP size. An explicit value is","+used as given and rejected if it is invalid; validation suggests the minimum","+valid count when one value works for all draft layers. This applies to Eagle,","+Eagle3, MTP, DFlash, and supported DSpark drafts. A single redundant-expert","+count must make every draft layer's total expert count divisible by the EP","+size; configuration fails when the draft's layers require different padding","+counts.","+For DSpark drafts, divisibility is checked against the target EP group. If EPLB","+is enabled and `draft_tensor_parallel_size` is `1`, prefill context parallelism","+or data parallelism must also be greater than `1`.","+Draft EPLB for DSpark is not supported with Elastic EP; set","+`speculative_config.draft_enable_eplb=false` to disable EPLB for the draft.","+"," ### EPLB Parameters"," "," Configure EPLB with the `--eplb-config` argument, which accepts a JSON string. The available keys and their descriptions are:","@@ -209,7 +248,8 @@ Configure EPLB with the `--eplb-config` argument, which accepts a JSON string. T"," | `window_size` | Number of engine steps to track for rebalancing decisions | 1000 |"," | `step_interval` | Frequency of rebalancing (every N engine steps) | 3000 |"," | `log_balancedness` | Log balancedness metrics (avg tokens per expert ÷ max tokens per expert) | `false` |","-| `num_redundant_experts` | Additional global experts per EP rank beyond equal distribution | `0` |","+| `num_redundant_experts` | Additional experts needed to make the total divisible by EP size; computed when unset | `auto` |","+| `draft_num_redundant_experts` | Redundant expert count for a speculative MoE draft; inherits a valid target count for matching routed expert counts, otherwise computed when unset. Invalid explicit values fail validation with a suggested minimum when possible. Ignored without a speculative MoE draft. | `auto` |"," | `use_async` | Use non-blocking EPLB for reduced latency overhead | `true` |"," | `policy` | The policy type for expert parallel load balancing | `\"default\"` |"," | `communicator` | Backend for expert weight transfers: `\"torch_nccl\"`, `\"torch_gloo\"`, `\"pynccl\"`, `\"nixl\"`, `\"symm_mem\"`, or `null` (auto) | `null` |","@@ -233,6 +273,16 @@ vllm serve Qwen/Qwen3-30B-A3B \\","             --eplb-config.log_balancedness true","     ```"," ","+For speculative decoding with a MoE draft, configure both speculative decoding","+and the draft-specific EPLB count:","+","+```bash","+vllm serve <target-moe-model> \\","+  --enable-eplb \\","+  --eplb-config '{\"num_redundant_experts\":2,\"draft_num_redundant_experts\":2}' \\","+  --speculative-config '{\"method\":\"draft_model\",\"model\":\"<draft-moe-model>\",\"num_speculative_tokens\":5}'","+```","+"," ### Expert Distribution Formula"," "," - **Default**: Each EP rank has `NUM_TOTAL_EXPERTS ÷ NUM_EP_RANKS` experts"],"additions":51,"deletions":1,"truncated":false},{"path":"tests/distributed/test_eplb_spec_decode.py","lines":["@@ -7,16 +7,10 @@"," import lm_eval"," import pytest"," import torch","-from transformers import DeepseekV4Config"," "," from tests.utils import large_gpu_mark","-from vllm.distributed.eplb.eplb_state import EplbState","-from vllm.models.deepseek_v4.common.eplb_util import dspark_draft_supports_eplb"," from vllm.platforms import current_platform","-from vllm.v1.worker.gpu.eplb_utils import (","-    EPLBController,","-    draft_model_supports_eplb,","-)","+from vllm.v1.worker.gpu.eplb_utils import EPLBController"," "," "," def get_model_args(","@@ -78,128 +72,140 @@ def add_model(","         self.add_model_calls.append((model, model_config, model_name))"," "," ","-def _make_dsv4_dspark_hf_config() -> DeepseekV4Config:","-    return DeepseekV4Config(","-        architectures=[\"DeepseekV4ForCausalLM\"],","-        hidden_size=128,","-        num_hidden_layers=2,","-        n_routed_experts=8,","-        num_experts_per_tok=2,","-        num_hash_layers=0,","-        n_shared_experts=1,","-        moe_intermediate_size=128,","-        hc_mult=1,","-        hc_eps=1e-5,","-        rms_norm_eps=1e-5,","-        dspark_target_layer_ids=[0],","-        dspark_markov_rank=8,","-        index_topk=4,","-        head_dim=64,","-        num_attention_heads=4,","-        vocab_size=256,","-        n_mtp_layers=2,","-        enable_confidence_head=False,","-        layer_types=[\"sliding_attention\"] * 2,","-    )","-","-"," @pytest.fixture"," def dspark_vllm_config():","-    hf_config = _make_dsv4_dspark_hf_config()","-    model_config = SimpleNamespace(","-        dtype=torch.bfloat16, hf_config=hf_config, model=\"dspark\"","+    draft_model_config = SimpleNamespace(","+        model=\"dspark\",","+        hf_config=SimpleNamespace(model_type=\"deepseek_v4\"),","     )","     return SimpleNamespace(","-        model_config=model_config,","-        quant_config=None,","-        kernel_config=SimpleNamespace(moe_backend=\"deep_gemm_mega_moe\"),","         parallel_config=SimpleNamespace(","-            pipeline_parallel_size=1,","-            tensor_parallel_size=1,","-            data_parallel_size=1,","-            enable_expert_parallel=True,","             enable_eplb=True,","             enable_elastic_ep=False,","-            eplb_config=SimpleNamespace(num_redundant_experts=4),","         ),","-        scheduler_config=SimpleNamespace(max_num_batched_tokens=4),","-        compilation_config=SimpleNamespace(static_forward_context={}),","         speculative_config=SimpleNamespace(","             method=\"dspark\",","-            draft_model_config=model_config,","+            draft_model_config=draft_model_config,","         ),","     )"," "," ","-def _make_moe_topol